  {
    "type": "updateEntity",
    "id": {
      "$bytes": "6ce956de8cc047178c33046dd525009d"
    },
    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Saga high-dosage math tutoring (Chicago trial model)",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "In-school tutoring evaluated in two Chicago high-school trials. The studied model paired one tutor with two students for daily math instruction.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
  {
    "type": "createRelation",
    "id": {
      "$bytes": "3b3c144f084246e3b0af0dd62cc210bd"
    },
    "entity": {
      "$bytes": "90c4be37424d4fbba6bab054e65af237"
    },
    "from": {
      "$bytes": "6ce956de8cc047178c33046dd525009d"
    },
    "to": {
      "$bytes": "2f3e568ca8cb4d6ea130829c3012648f"
    },
    "relationType": {
      "$bytes": "8f151ba4de204e3c9cb499ddf96f48f1"
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "updateEntity",
    "id": {
      "$bytes": "e64b7ea956f44e3c92fb6be52a10682e"
    },
    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Saga Chicago tutoring: delivery and provider context",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Studied delivery model\n\nStudents received 50-minute sessions each school day, combining remedial and grade-level mathematics with frequent assessments. Paraprofessional tutors worked with two students; tutoring supplemented regular math classes. Its timetable displaced different courses in the two trials.\n\n## Provider history and scope\n\nThe article calls the developer Saga Education and explains its origins in Match Education, its spin-off as SAGA Innovations, and its 2019 name change. The provider link identifies that organization and program lineage; it does not assert that the current legal organization operated independently throughout the first trial. This record represents the studied Chicago model, not every later Saga service or technology-assisted variant.\n\n## Evidence\n\n[Final journal article](https://doi.org/10.1257/aer.20210434), printed pp. 740–743. The two trials have distinct study records. Their costs retain an unverified price year; no new efficiency metric is inferred.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
  {
