        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Saga Chicago tutoring study 1 (2013–2014): sample and comparison",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Sample and comparison\n\nThe trial randomized 2,633 students before school entry. Usual school supports remained available to controls. The outcome-complete sample sizes on the linked estimates are not total randomized enrollment.\n\n## Source\n\n[Final journal article](https://doi.org/10.1257/aer.20210434), printed pp. 741–743 and Table 3.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
