          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Sample and comparison\n\nThe trial involved 2,645 students but 2,710 randomization records because 65 students were randomized twice. Analyses retained those records and clustered standard errors by student. Controls could receive usual school supports.\n\n## Source\n\n[Final journal article](https://doi.org/10.1257/aer.20210434), printed p. 743, footnote 10, and Table 4.",
